"P2425288417" "<x=0.5 y=0.4 t=5 d=5><scale 1.75><Color White><bgcolor darkred>Each with their own roles, these professionals managed to escape with an unimaginable sum of cash, much to the chagrin of the casino's Chief of Security, Ted Dubois."
