"P940017388" "<X=0.7 y=0.7 t=6 d=6><scale 1.75><Color black> <bgcolor IndianRed>That required the Grifter to meet Ted Dubois in his own office in order to record each segment of the Verbal Pass Code so that the Thief could actually open the vault."
