// Answer Text :
"P1955988121" "'Ah, gotcha. Well, good luck!' - [Walk Away]"
// Page Inq1 Text :
"P1865986915" "Heh, you know. . . Hot. Like, 'I shouldn't press my luck'. I've got a little 'technique', I guess you could call it, wherein I. . . Well, hah! If you want those specifics I might have to charge you! It's a secret only the professionals know."
