"P630773694" "You shouldn't be seeing this."
// Page Convo2Start Text :
"P998309457" "Alright! You've been following my numbers. Do you think I'm ready?"
// Answer Text :
"P1963545370" "As ever! Get out there and play!"
// Answer Text :
"P1826651202" "Actually, I've got a bad feeling about this. Take it easy today and try again tomorrow."
