"P42850028" "I'm sorry to hear that! Inexperienced at Blackjack?"
// Answer Text :
// Page Inq1 Text :
"P3161844550" "Inexperienced at gambling just in general.  I was taken to understand it's all just odds and probability, but I've yet to figure out the 'trick' of it. I would absolutely HATE to walk away from here a loser, so I'm just watching people play for a bit. I'll see if I can't give it a better go in a few minutes."
// Answer Text :
"P554447389" "Care for any tips from a pro?"
// Page Inq2 Text :
"P405039515" "That's very kind of you, I'd love some assistance!"
// Answer Text :
"P533785262" "Excellent. There's a lot to go over!"
// Page Inq3 Text :
// Page Convo2Start Text :
"P4002085482" "I'm still not sure about the ethics of this, but then again, there's not much ethical about this establishment anyway. Do you think I'm ready?"
// Answer Text :
"P4075511510" "Definitely! And don't forget - just have fun while you're taking all their chips."
// Answer Text :
"P3339759934" "Actually, you're right - this IS unethical and you shouldn't lower yourself to this."
// Page Teach Text :
