// Answer Text :
"P2495567002" "Woah! You want some tricks to help even the score?"
// Page Inq2 Text :
"P3001258668" "Well, I was just going to wait until they up and left and then jumped them in the parking lot, but they might lose all my money by then. . . I can win my money back and THEN assault them in the parking lot!"
