"P4274360059" "Hah! I like your style. Okay, listen up!"
// Page Inq3 Text :
// Page Convo2Start Text :
"P3046999504" "You know, people don't know it to look at me, what with my big stature and unkempt beard and clothes, but I'm a pretty smart guy. You're the first person in a long time to not take one look at me and treat me like a complete dolt. You're alright."
